    "name": {
      "value": "Egg Cream Fizz"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Containing neither eggs nor cream, an egg cream fizz contains milk or nut milk, sparkling water, and flavored syrup, frothed and chilled. Upon drinking, you feel lighter and more buoyant, gaining a +5-foot item bonus to your Speed for 10 minutes.\n\nDuring this time, you also gain another effect determined by the drink's syrup, which is chosen when the drink is created.\n\n- Chocolate You gain a +1 item bonus to Acrobatics checks to Balance, Maneuver in Flight, and Squeeze.\n- Strawberry You gain a +1 item bonus to Athletics checks to Climb, Leap, and Swim.\n- Vanilla You can Step into difficult terrain.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
    },
